---
description: API route and server action patterns
globs: ["src/app/api/**/*.ts", "src/actions/**/*.ts", "app/api/**/*.ts", "actions/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Validate all inputs with Zod before processing
- Return typed responses, never plain objects
- Use try/catch with structured error responses
- Server actions use the 'use server' directive
- No secrets in route handlers — use environment variables
